PLACEHOLDER — NOT A REAL SCREENSHOT. DO NOT SUBMIT WITH THIS FILE IN PLACE.

This file reserves the name screenshot.png, which the bring-the-humans-02 rules
require at the root of the repository: a screenshot (PNG, JPEG or WebP, at most
8 MB and at most 16,000,000 pixels) of THIS repository's page on GitHub with the
README rendered below it, taken after the repository is published.

Action for whoever publishes the repository:
1. Create/push this repository on GitHub as rebahan149/bring-the-humans-02-guide.
2. Open the repository page so the repo name and the top of the README are visible.
3. Take a full-page screenshot whose TOP shows the repository name and the start
   of the README (the leaderboard and Feed crop a square from the top edge).
4. Save it over this file, keeping the exact name screenshot.png, and commit.
